-- mod-hearthstone: the Curse of Naxxramas quest step. Its ids match src/quests/HsNaxxQuestData.h.
--
-- Quests: 919932 breadcrumb (no start relation, Ezra 919501 and Ibelin 919502 offer it in the module gossip, the
-- Arachnid quarter NPC ends it), 919933 to 919961 the 29 quests of the adventure (15 boss, 9 class challenge and
-- 5 wing completions). Boss and challenge quests are event quests (SpecialFlags 2), wing quests are plain turn-ins.
-- The quarter NPCs (16112, 16113, 16115, 16116, 11034) are existing creatures and PROVISIONAL: they are only
-- referenced here (their templates and spawns are never written). Change quarters[].npc in the JSON to move them.
-- Stand-ins: 920000 to 920014 are the 15 bosses (name Simulacrum, gossip only, ghost visual aura, one stationary spawn each), gossip menus 65253 to 65267,
-- texts 9195904 to 9195918, one hearthstone_opponent row each (difficulty boss, deck_key = the encounter key).
-- Items: 919652 to 919681, one per granted card (openable, class 15), quest 919955 also rewards 919681.
-- Spawns: one stationary spawn each, GUIDs allocated by the database.
-- Rebuilt each run. Only the ids named below are touched. The file has no backslashes.

