INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`entry`, `male_text`, `female_text`) VALUES
  (9195904, "A pale likeness of Anub'Rekhan flickers here, drawn from the accounts of those who survived his halls. Study how his swarm spills across the board: every wasted turn leaves more Nerubians to answer for, so learn to clear the many before they overwhelm you.", "A pale likeness of Anub'Rekhan flickers here, drawn from the accounts of those who survived his halls. Study how his swarm spills across the board: every wasted turn leaves more Nerubians to answer for, so learn to clear the many before they overwhelm you."),
  (9195905, "The ghostly Widow keeps her hand of devotion close. Her fire falls once for every card still held against you, so learn to spend your hand instead of hoarding it, and let nothing sit idle in your grasp.", "The ghostly Widow keeps her hand of devotion close. Her fire falls once for every card still held against you, so learn to spend your hand instead of hoarding it, and let nothing sit idle in your grasp."),
  (9195906, "A faint, many-legged image of Maexxna hangs in the air. Her web drags your best minions back into your hand, so learn to keep your tempo with cheap, steady threats instead of staking everything on one great beast.", "A faint, many-legged image of Maexxna hangs in the air. Her web drags your best minions back into your hand, so learn to keep your tempo with cheap, steady threats instead of staking everything on one great beast."),
  (9195907, "The echo of Noth the Plaguebringer stands patiently. Every death at his table raises another skeleton for him, so learn which trades are worth making and which only feed the plague.", "The echo of Noth the Plaguebringer stands patiently. Every death at his table raises another skeleton for him, so learn which trades are worth making and which only feed the plague."),
  (9195908, "A shimmering likeness of Heigan dances here. His eruption strikes the minion on your far left, so learn to arrange your board: put a sturdy blocker, or something you will not miss, where the blow will fall.", "A shimmering likeness of Heigan dances here. His eruption strikes the minion on your far left, so learn to arrange your board: put a sturdy blocker, or something you will not miss, where the blow will fall."),
  (9195909, "Loatheb's spectral shape is vast and slow. His aura gnaws at you each turn while his own flesh will not yield quickly, so learn to count your life against his, and to keep pressing when the fight drags on.", "Loatheb's spectral shape is vast and slow. His aura gnaws at you each turn while his own flesh will not yield quickly, so learn to count your life against his, and to keep pressing when the fight drags on."),
  (9195910, "The image of Instructor Razuvious drills his ghostly understudies. They guard him as he strikes, so learn to cut through the guards first and not to waste your strength on a target that cannot be reached.", "The image of Instructor Razuvious drills his ghostly understudies. They guard him as he strikes, so learn to cut through the guards first and not to waste your strength on a target that cannot be reached."),
  (9195911, "A drifting likeness of Gothik the Harvester watches over the field. He draws and he reaps, so learn to measure the pace of the fight and to answer what falls before the dead rise against you.", "A drifting likeness of Gothik the Harvester watches over the field. He draws and he reaps, so learn to measure the pace of the fight and to answer what falls before the dead rise against you."),
  (9195912, "The Baron's likeness is thin and frail, a rider with little life behind him. The Four Horsemen fall quickly to the bold, so learn to press fast and straight for the heart before they ride you down.", "The Baron's likeness is thin and frail, a rider with little life behind him. The Four Horsemen fall quickly to the bold, so learn to press fast and straight for the heart before they ride you down."),
  (9195913, "Patchwerk's pale shape is huge, even as an echo. His strike destroys whatever you set up best, so learn to spread your threats across the board instead of hanging everything on a single champion.", "Patchwerk's pale shape is huge, even as an echo. His strike destroys whatever you set up best, so learn to spread your threats across the board instead of hanging everything on a single champion."),
  (9195914, "The glowing outline of Grobbulus oozes where it stands. His cloud scorches every minion for a point, so learn which of your creatures can endure it, and be ready for the slimes that rise from what perishes.", "The glowing outline of Grobbulus oozes where it stands. His cloud scorches every minion for a point, so learn which of your creatures can endure it, and be ready for the slimes that rise from what perishes."),
  (9195915, "A ravenous likeness of Gluth lingers here. His decimation leaves every minion with a single point of health, so learn that raw strength and buffs are fragile against him, and keep the pressure on quick strikes.", "A ravenous likeness of Gluth lingers here. His decimation leaves every minion with a single point of health, so learn that raw strength and buffs are fragile against him, and keep the pressure on quick strikes."),
  (9195916, "The echo of Thaddius crackles with false lightning. His polarity shift swaps the attack and health of every minion, so learn to think of each creature both ways, and not to trust a strong body or a feeble one.", "The echo of Thaddius crackles with false lightning. His polarity shift swaps the attack and health of every minion, so learn to think of each creature both ways, and not to trust a strong body or a feeble one."),
  (9195917, "A cold, ghostly Sapphiron hangs above the floor. His breath destroys every enemy minion that is not frozen, so learn to hold back, to commit only what you can afford to lose, and to keep cards in reserve.", "A cold, ghostly Sapphiron hangs above the floor. His breath destroys every enemy minion that is not frozen, so learn to hold back, to commit only what you can afford to lose, and to keep cards in reserve."),
  (9195918, "The likeness of Kel'Thuzad is faint but sharp. His frost freezes and chains turn your own minions against you for a turn, so learn to play with care, and to keep your best creatures back when his chains are near.", "The likeness of Kel'Thuzad is faint but sharp. His frost freezes and chains turn your own minions against you for a turn, so learn to play with care, and to keep your best creatures back when his chains are near.");

